{"verse_key": "10:28", "surah": 10, "verse": 28, "text_uthmani": "وَيَوْمَ نَحْشُرُهُمْ جَمِيعًا ثُمَّ نَقُولُ لِلَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا۟ مَكَانَكُمْ أَنتُمْ وَشُرَكَآؤُكُمْ ۚ فَزَيَّلْنَا بَيْنَهُمْ ۖ وَقَالَ شُرَكَآؤُهُم مَّا كُنتُمْ إِيَّانَا تَعْبُدُونَ", "translation": "And [mention, O Muḥammad], the Day We will gather them all together - then We will say to those who associated others with Allāh, \"[Remain in] your place, you and your 'partners.'\"<sup foot_note=196444>1</sup> Then We will separate them,<sup foot_note=196443>2</sup> and their \"partners\" will say, \"You did not used to worship us,<sup foot_note=196442>3</sup>", "verse_from_ms": 742740, "verse_to_ms": 770610, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَيَوْمَ", "start_ms": 742740, "end_ms": 743980}, {"i": 1, "text": "نَحْشُرُهُمْ", "start_ms": 743980, "end_ms": 745150}, {"i": 2, "text": "جَمِيعًا", "start_ms": 745150, "end_ms": 746630}, {"i": 3, "text": "ثُمَّ", "start_ms": 746630, "end_ms": 747720}, {"i": 4, "text": "نَقُولُ", "start_ms": 747720, "end_ms": 748560}, {"i": 5, "text": "لِلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 748560, "end_ms": 749710}, {"i": 6, "text": "أَشْرَكُوا۟", "start_ms": 749710, "end_ms": 750780}, {"i": 7, "text": "مَكَانَكُمْ", "start_ms": 750780, "end_ms": 752010}, {"i": 8, "text": "أَنتُمْ", "start_ms": 752010, "end_ms": 753200}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَشُرَكَآؤُكُمْ", "start_ms": 753200, "end_ms": 757600}, {"i": 10, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 757600, "end_ms": 759010}, {"i": 11, "text": "فَزَيَّلْنَا", "start_ms": 759010, "end_ms": 760070}, {"i": 12, "text": "بَيْنَهُمْ", "start_ms": 760070, "end_ms": 760810}, {"i": 13, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 760810, "end_ms": 763710}, {"i": 14, "text": "وَقَالَ", "start_ms": 763710, "end_ms": 764630}, {"i": 15, "text": "شُرَكَآؤُهُم", "start_ms": 764630, "end_ms": 766050}, {"i": 16, "text": "مَّا", "start_ms": 766050, "end_ms": 767200}, {"i": 17, "text": "كُنتُمْ", "start_ms": 7672